```text
CITY ENGINEERING
2101 O'Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming82001
CHOICE
MEMO
DATE:
November 8,2010
TO:
Mayor Richard L.Kaysen, City Council
FROM:
Sam Berta, Staff Engineer
SUBJECT: Snyder Avenue48-Inch Storm water Pipeline
This contract modification will be the completion of the Carey Avenue Extension.This
modification will pay for these unforeseen changes needed for the completion of the project.
This work included replacement of a 15”sewer line andmanhole, replacement ofawater tap at
905 Randall and miscellaneous parts. All of the additional work was requested by the Board of
Public Utilities.The additional funds will be reimbursed by the BOPU.Changes totaling
$14,923.22provided services to complete the necessary changes.
Respectfully,
Sam Berta
Staff Engineer
```

